{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>the fifth time</b><br>I would soil them. In the language of the Rabbis, the language of defilement (ge'ul and tinuf)." "<b>the third time</b><br>Speech of Knesset Israel: because I delayed to build the house and my deeds were not pleasing, He rebuked me through the prophet Haggai [and Zechariah son of Iddo]."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "Resolved abbreviation רז״ל as רבותינו זכרונם לברכה, 'the Rabbis.' The parenthetical (גיאול וטינוף) is given as a synonym gloss.", 1 "Resolved אמר׳ as אמרת, 'speech of.' The bracketed [הבית] and [וזכריה בן עדוא] are supplied in the source text as completions of ellipses."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:42.539836795Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}